(label "RADIO_A_DIO11" (at 309.88 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 276a09ac-24c4-5c57-9ef5-e50ba4f29a26))
(wire (pts (xy 370.84 210.82) (xy 381 210.82)) (stroke (width 0) (type default)) (uuid 776b36d2-b76f-5798-9f28-c53cd385bac3))
(label "RADIO_B_DIO11" (at 381 210.82 0) (effects (font (size 0.9 0.9) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid c5dc91f4-909d-53ba-ba6a-c40c7e980763))
(text "USB-C CONTROLLER SOCKETS\nJ1 = vendor P1; J2 = vendor P2. USB end faces carrier top.\n22.86 mm between rows. Socket pin 1 is at antenna end." (at 25.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid ffaa9d69-c91a-5411-8765-c9e5141ade2b))
(text "RADIO A SOCKETS\nTop view: upper row module pins 8..1 left to right; lower 9..16.\nAntennas connect to module IPEX4 ports at right." (at 172.72 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid 34a533f6-463b-5874-87f1-3b354ae13473))
(text "RADIO B SOCKETS\nSame wiring and orientation as Radio A.\nBoth sockets support either band and modulation." (at 279.4 20.32 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid 4a1b54d4-5506-5ca4-a73c-ac9bf21ec3ff))
(text "POWER\nUSB_5V is controller P1.21, downstream of its D1 diode.\nU1 output is separate from controller 3V3 pins.\nNo external power input. Radio allowance 300 mA.\nValidate USB allowance, controller D1 heat, and voltage drop." (at 25.4 134.62 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid bd0a5e1d-2572-52ef-98c4-2a953cc43bb4))
(text "FIRMWARE\nCS defaults high. Reset and initialize both radios at boot.\nWait for each BUSY low before commands. One CS active at a time.\nStart SPI at 2 MHz. DIO11 is a radio pin name, not ESP32 GPIO11.\nKeep Wi-Fi/Bluetooth off for initial RF tests." (at 25.4 220.98 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid 99be8d5d-e1e3-54e3-844c-4a798c089fee))
(text "RADIO CONTACTS\nRF header pins 1 and 16 and NC pin 6 have no carrier traces.\nDIO7 and DIO8 are reserved and unconnected in this revision.\nManufacturer pinout image is an underside view.\nSocket numbering here follows the documented TOP view." (at 172.72 231.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid b2593443-0a8c-5543-8f87-65084ba08f5d))
(text "ENGINEERING PROTOTYPE\nNative KiCad ERC/DRC required; sample socket-fit checks pending.\nNo hardware or radio performance has been validated.\nDo not substitute generic LM/AMS1117 for ceramic-stable TLV1117LV." (at 279.4 231.14 0) (effects (font (size 1.1 1.1) (thickness 0.15)) (justify left top)) (uuid 0c0fab4f-26f8-50d7-8123-cabeb5ea5253))
